{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33805","headline":"太湖诗 崦里 · 皮日休","name":"太湖诗 崦里","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"崦里何幽奇，膏腴二十顷。\n风吹稻花香，直过龟山顶。\n青苗细腻卧，白羽悠溶静。\n塍畔起鸊鹈，田中通舴艋。\n几家傍潭洞，孤戍当林岭。\n罢钓时煑菱，停缲或焙茗。\n峭然八十翁，生计於此永。\n苦力供征赋，怡颜过朝暝。\n洞庭取异事，包山极幽景。\n念尔饱得知，亦是遗民幸。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皮日休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33805.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33805","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}